<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0468_T04FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ run into MAD Hustlers on the\nway to Cerulean Cape.\rThey wanna see how they stack up.\nIt’s a whole gauntlet. Bring snacks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0468_T04FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Misty the only one in town who can\nbeat the Hustlers at Cerulean Cape.\rShe scary. I like her. I’m scared of\nher.</language>
	</row>
</body>
